package localization

// These descriptions are explicit translations of the corresponding fixed
// methodology.Tools registry entries. Command syntax, flags, paths, package
// identifiers, and quoted output remain exact; only explanatory prose changes.
func init() {
	add := func(language string, translations map[string]string) {
		for source, translated := range translations {
			catalogs[language][source] = translated
		}
	}
	add("ru", map[string]string{
		"Usage: hotam gen-spec [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--claude-md <path>]. Regenerates docs/gen/*.md + graph.json for a domain graph from the executable model (internal/generator + internal/ontology), making drift structurally impossible.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            "Usage: hotam gen-spec [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--claude-md <path>]. Пересоздаёт docs/gen/*.md и graph.json домена по исполняемой модели (internal/generator + internal/ontology), структурно исключая расхождения.",
		"Usage: hotam what-now [--domain <path>] [--limit N] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. Derives the prioritized next correct action from any graph state (internal/diagnose), making being-lost structurally impossible.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "Usage: hotam what-now [--domain <path>] [--limit N] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. Вычисляет следующий приоритетный корректный шаг для любого состояния графа (internal/diagnose), структурно исключая потерю ориентации.",
		"Usage: hotam apply-proposal <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>]. Mechanical writer for resolver-approved JSON proposals (internal/proposal): consumes an approved Proposed* JSON and applies the change to a domain graph.json.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "Usage: hotam apply-proposal <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>]. Механически применяет одобренные resolver-ом JSON-предложения (internal/proposal) к graph.json домена.",
		"Usage: hotam gate <target-anchor> [--domain <path>]. T1 tiered LAND gate (internal/gate): selects a targeted enforcer subset for a target node instead of the full test suite.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "Usage: hotam gate <target-anchor> [--domain <path>]. Многоуровневый LAND gate T1 (internal/gate): выбирает целевой набор проверок для узла вместо полного набора тестов.",
		"Usage: hotam all-violations [--domain <path>]. Prints all invariant violations for a domain graph (internal/invariants); exits 1 if any are found.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                "Usage: hotam all-violations [--domain <path>]. Выводит все нарушения инвариантов графа домена (internal/invariants); завершает работу с кодом 1 при наличии нарушений.",
		"Usage: hotam req <show|list|search|context|related> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. Compact agentic read interface over the domain graph (internal/query): answers 'what is R-x' / 'what touches R-x' without loading the full graph.json or a generated doc.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "Usage: hotam req <show|list|search|context|related> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. Компактный агентный интерфейс чтения графа домена (internal/query): отвечает на вопросы «что такое R-x» и «что связано с R-x» без загрузки graph.json или сгенерированного документа целиком.",
		"Usage: hotam brief <anchor-id> [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Single-call aggregation of everything an agent needs to fully orient on one anchor (internal/query.Brief): the full card + one-hop neighborhood + freshness classification for Requirements, replacing the 3-4 separate round-trips (req show + req context + req related + due). Works for Requirement, Conflict, and Assumption anchors alike.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "Usage: hotam brief <anchor-id> [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. За один вызов собирает всё необходимое для ориентации по якорю (internal/query.Brief): полную карточку, соседей на один переход и свежесть Requirement, заменяя 3–4 отдельных запроса (req show + req context + req related + due). Поддерживает якоря Requirement, Conflict и Assumption.",
		"Usage: hotam due [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Advisory report of OVERDUE and NEVER-REVIEWED SETTLED requirements (internal/freshness); never gates, exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       "Usage: hotam due [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Информационный отчёт о ПРОСРОЧЕННЫХ и НИКОГДА НЕ ПРОВЕРЯВШИХСЯ требованиях SETTLED (internal/freshness); не блокирует работу, код выхода всегда 0.",
		"Usage: hotam status [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Single-shot compact summary combining what-now's top action + debt (internal/diagnose), due's freshness counts (internal/freshness), and all-violations' violation count (internal/invariants), so an agent doesn't need to run all three separately. Never gates; exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       "Usage: hotam status [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Краткая сводка одним вызовом: главное действие и долг из what-now (internal/diagnose), счётчики свежести из due (internal/freshness) и число нарушений из all-violations (internal/invariants). Не блокирует работу; код выхода всегда 0.",
		"Usage: hotam inspect [--domain <path>] [--json] [--limit N] [--min-score N]. Advisory listing of semantic conflict candidates with evidence (internal/diagnose): shared-assumption clusters, entity-state suspects, lexical claim overlap, axis co-reference. --min-score (default 5) suppresses low-signal candidates; 0 shows all. Never gates; exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             "Usage: hotam inspect [--domain <path>] [--json] [--limit N] [--min-score N]. Информационный список кандидатов семантических конфликтов с доказательствами (internal/diagnose): общие допущения, подозрительные состояния сущностей, лексическое пересечение формулировок и соотнесение осей. --min-score (default 5) скрывает слабые сигналы; 0 показывает всё. Не блокирует работу; код выхода всегда 0.",
		"Usage: hotam confront <text> [--domain <path>] [--file <path>] [--json]. CONFRONT step of the mediation loop (internal/diagnose): checks a candidate claim for lexical overlap with SETTLED requirements (duplicate guard) and REJECTED history (anti-relitigation) before anything is written. <text> is a quoted positional; --file <path> reads a long draft. Reuses the inspect overlap engine. Never gates; exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                              "Usage: hotam confront <text> [--domain <path>] [--file <path>] [--json]. Шаг CONFRONT цикла согласования (internal/diagnose): до записи проверяет лексическое пересечение кандидатной формулировки с требованиями SETTLED (защита от дублей) и историей REJECTED (защита от повторного обсуждения). <text> передаётся как аргумент в кавычках; --file <path> читает длинный черновик. Использует механизм пересечений inspect. Не блокирует работу; код выхода всегда 0.",
		"Usage: hotam land <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>] [--claude-md <path>]. Single CLI entry point over apply-proposal -> gen-spec -> all-violations (internal/proposal + internal/generator + internal/invariants).":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               "Usage: hotam land <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>] [--claude-md <path>]. Единая точка CLI для apply-proposal -> gen-spec -> all-violations (internal/proposal + internal/generator + internal/invariants).",
		"Usage: hotam init <dir> [--name <domain-name>]. Scaffolds a new domain: minimal graph.json (seed Stakeholder + seed SETTLED Requirement, all-violations=0 immediately), manifest.json, docs/gen/, and a README.md pointing at the next commands to run. <dir> may be anywhere on disk.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            "Usage: hotam init <dir> [--name <domain-name>]. Создаёт новый домен: минимальный graph.json (начальные Stakeholder и Requirement со статусом SETTLED, сразу all-violations=0), manifest.json, docs/gen/ и README.md со следующими командами. <dir> может находиться в любом месте диска.",
		"Usage: hotam init-project <dir> [--domain <name>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. Bootstraps an external business project's full Hotam-Spec layout in one call: scaffolds a base domain under <dir>/domains/<name> (default main) via init, writes the project-root marker (.hotam-spec-project), and renders the root crystal (CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/GEMINI.md) + all docs/gen/* via gen-spec. Refuses to overwrite an existing project marker or CLAUDE.md.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                 "Usage: hotam init-project <dir> [--domain <name>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. Одним вызовом создаёт полный каркас Hotam-Spec для внешнего бизнес-проекта: создаёт базовый домен в <dir>/domains/<name> (по умолчанию main) командой init, записывает маркер проекта (.hotam-spec-project) и генерирует корневой кристалл (CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/GEMINI.md) и все docs/gen/* командой gen-spec. Не перезаписывает существующий маркер проекта или CLAUDE.md.",
		"Usage: hotam use <domain-name>. Sets the active-domain preference for the current project: records {\"active_domain\": \"<name>\"} in the project-root marker so a bare `hotam <command>` (no --domain) targets the chosen domain. Refuses if <root>/domains/<name>/graph.json does not exist.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "Usage: hotam use <domain-name>. Задаёт активный домен проекта: записывает {\"active_domain\": \"<name>\"} в корневой маркер проекта, чтобы `hotam <command>` без --domain использовала выбранный домен. Отказывает, если <root>/domains/<name>/graph.json не существует.",
		"Usage: hotam propose <requirement|rejection|stakeholder|axis|assumption|conflict> [flags] [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--out <path>] [--land] [--claude-md <path>] [--json]. Drafts valid proposal JSON from flags (schema knowledge in the tool, not agent memory), runs an automatic confront check before writing, and optionally --land (apply+regen+reverify) in the same call. Other complex kinds (ConflictTransition, EntityType, …) keep the hand-authored-JSON path (hotam land <file.json>).":                                                                                                                                                "Usage: hotam propose <requirement|rejection|stakeholder|axis|assumption|conflict> [flags] [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--out <path>] [--land] [--claude-md <path>] [--json]. Создаёт корректный JSON-проект из flags (схема задаётся инструментом, а не памятью агента), перед записью автоматически выполняет confront и при необходимости запускает --land (apply+regen+reverify) в том же вызове. Для сложных типов (ConflictTransition, EntityType, …) сохраняется путь ручного JSON (hotam land <file.json>).",
		"Usage: hotam version, hotam --version. Prints the hotam binary's version, commit, and build date (build-time defaults \"dev\"/\"unknown\"/\"unknown\", overridable via -ldflags -X main.version/commit/buildDate).":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                "Usage: hotam version, hotam --version. Выводит версию бинарного файла hotam, commit и дату сборки (значения по умолчанию при сборке — \"dev\"/\"unknown\"/\"unknown\", можно задать через -ldflags -X main.version/commit/buildDate).",
		"Usage: hotam sync-self [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. Mirrors the engine's own Go requirements registry onto the self-hosting domain's graph.json, this repository's own domain only. Default dry-run computes the pending ADDED/CHANGED sync report, previews the confront/pre-post-violation/append-only gates, and prints a diff-hash; --confirm-hash re-verifies against the current on-disk state and, if every gate passes, writes graph.json, regenerates docs, and re-verifies with all-violations (rolling back on any post-write failure).": "Usage: hotam sync-self [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. Проецирует собственный реестр требований Go-движка в graph.json домена self-hosting только этого репозитория. По умолчанию dry-run формирует отчёт ADDED/CHANGED, показывает проверки confront/pre-post-violation/append-only и печатает diff-hash; --confirm-hash повторно проверяет текущее состояние диска и при успешных проверках записывает graph.json, пересоздаёт документы и запускает all-violations (откат при ошибке после записи).",
		"Usage: hotam vendor-ontology --domain <path>. Copies the engine's canonical minimal Requirement + Registry[T] mirror (internal/ontology/canon) into <domain>/spec/hotamontology/{requirement,registry}.go, banner-stamped do-not-edit. Requires <domain>/spec/go.mod to already exist (the domain's own Go module for its authored spec/ tree); idempotent, always overwrites with the current canon.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             "Usage: hotam vendor-ontology --domain <path>. Копирует минимальное каноническое зеркало Requirement + Registry[T] (internal/ontology/canon) в <domain>/spec/hotamontology/{requirement,registry}.go с маркером «не редактировать». Требует существующий <domain>/spec/go.mod (Go-модуль домена для authored spec/); идемпотентна, всегда записывает текущую каноническую версию.",
		"Usage: hotam scaffold-registrydump --domain <path>. Writes <domain>/spec/registrydump/main.go, a minimal Go program that imports the domain's own spec/ module root package's Requirements registry plus the vendored spec/hotamontology package, and prints json.Marshal(Requirements.All()) to stdout. Requires spec/go.mod and an already-vendored spec/hotamontology (hotam vendor-ontology run first); idempotent.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "Usage: hotam scaffold-registrydump --domain <path>. Создаёт <domain>/spec/registrydump/main.go — минимальную программу Go, импортирующую реестр Requirements корневого пакета spec/ домена и vendored-пакет spec/hotamontology, а затем выводящую json.Marshal(Requirements.All()) в stdout. Требует spec/go.mod и предварительно созданный spec/hotamontology (сначала выполните hotam vendor-ontology); идемпотентна.",
		"Usage: hotam sync-domain --domain <path> [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. Mirrors a CONSUMER domain's own Go requirements registry (spec/requirements.go, read via a `go run ./registrydump` subprocess inside the domain's own spec/ module) onto that domain's graph.json — the domain-scoped generalization of hotam sync-self (task #366, RAC2 Phase B). Same dry-run-by-default / --confirm-hash handshake and confront/violation/append-only gate order as sync-self.":                                                                                              "Usage: hotam sync-domain --domain <path> [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. Проецирует собственный реестр требований Go домена CONSUMER (spec/requirements.go, читается subprocess-командой `go run ./registrydump` внутри модуля spec/) в graph.json домена; обобщает hotam sync-self для домена (task #366, RAC2 Phase B). Использует тот же dry-run по умолчанию, handshake --confirm-hash и порядок проверок confront/violation/append-only.",
		"Usage: hotam evidence [--domain <path>] [--json] [--write]. Collects source checks and per-test observations into a fresh evidence report; --write emits docs/gen/EVIDENCE.md, FINDINGS.md, and evidence.json without changing the graph, including when real checks fail.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "Usage: hotam evidence [--domain <path>] [--json] [--write]. Собирает проверки источников и наблюдения тестов в новый отчёт evidence; --write создаёт docs/gen/EVIDENCE.md, FINDINGS.md и evidence.json без изменения графа, даже если реальные проверки завершились ошибкой.",
		"Usage: hotam findings <list|show|review> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. Reads findings from the latest generated evidence report and stores explicit human classifications, statuses, rationale, and decision references separately from the immutable observed evidence.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     "Usage: hotam findings <list|show|review> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. Читает выводы из последнего отчёта evidence и хранит явные классификации человека, статусы, обоснования и ссылки на решения отдельно от неизменяемых наблюдений.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: the agent-agnostic CLI over the attention core.":                                                                                                              "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: CLI над ядром attention без привязки к агенту.",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: the Claude adapter that injects the attention list into context.":                                                    "Не реализовано (Python hook удалён в f61a574). Историческое назначение: адаптер Claude, добавляющий список attention в контекст.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: surfaces Requirements with compound claims and check_* functions with compound conditions, both structural signals for decomposition.":                        "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: выявлять Requirements со составными формулировками и функции check_* со составными условиями — структурные сигналы для декомпозиции.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: the generative-audit tool, a deterministic, LLM-free shortlist of latent-connector suspects.":                                                                 "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: инструмент generative-audit, детерминированный список подозрений на скрытые связи без LLM.",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: auto-injects the diff of CLAUDE.md since the operator's last turn into session context via a UserPromptSubmit hook.": "Не реализовано (Python hook удалён в f61a574). Историческое назначение: добавлять в контекст сессии diff CLAUDE.md после последнего хода оператора через hook UserPromptSubmit.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: per-action verify — did the proposal remove its diagnosis?":                                                                                                   "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: проверка каждого действия — устранило ли предложение диагностированную проблему?",
		"Not implemented. Historically: the operator's working-context measurement (reader + CLI dispatcher).":                                                                                        "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: измерение рабочего контекста оператора (reader + диспетчер CLI).",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: the producer half of the context cipher, writing a runtime context snapshot.":                                        "Не реализовано (Python hook удалён в f61a574). Историческое назначение: производящая часть context cipher, записывающая снимок контекста во время выполнения.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds domains/<domain>/agents/<name>/ as a self-contained sub-operator directory with its own CLAUDE.md, scope, tools/, agents/, and README.md.":          "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: создавать domains/<domain>/agents/<name>/ как автономный каталог субоператора с собственными CLAUDE.md, scope, tools/, agents/ и README.md.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds a new Axis into the active domain's controlled-vocabulary.":                                                                                         "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: добавлять новую Axis в контролируемый словарь активного домена.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds domains/<name>/ as a self-contained business domain with a manifest, graph.json, tools/, agents/director/, docs/gen/, and CLAUDE.md.":               "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: создавать domains/<name>/ как автономный бизнес-домен с manifest, graph.json, tools/, agents/director/, docs/gen/ и CLAUDE.md.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds an EntityType declaration into the active domain's graph via apply-proposal.":                                                                       "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: добавлять объявление EntityType в граф активного домена через apply-proposal.",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: emits the three-cipher pulse (top action / debt / context) directly from the active domain's graph.":                 "Не реализовано (Python hook удалён в f61a574). Историческое назначение: формировать три сигнала (главное действие / долг / контекст) непосредственно из графа активного домена.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: reads the runtime land-log and answers the commit-boundary question.":                                                                                         "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: читать журнал land во время выполнения и отвечать на вопрос о границе коммита.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: invokes a sub-agent by loading its CLAUDE.md as the operator-prompt and printing it to stdout.":                                                               "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: запускать субагента, загружая его CLAUDE.md как prompt оператора и выводя его в stdout.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: records that a DECIDED conflict's revisit_marker was evaluated.":                                                                                              "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: записывать факт оценки revisit_marker конфликта DECIDED.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: single CLI entry point over the low-traffic review tools.":                                                                                                    "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: единая точка CLI для редко используемых инструментов review.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: installs/removes the project-local hook that feeds the context producer.":                                                                                     "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: устанавливать или удалять локальный hook проекта, передающий данные context producer.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: generates the committable, portable project sensorium.":                                                                                                       "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: создавать переносимую инфраструктуру наблюдения проекта, пригодную для коммита.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: composes a sub-agent's task prompt by prepending the agent's CLAUDE.md crystal, so the subagent boots from substrate (not from raw text).":                    "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: формировать prompt задачи субагента, добавляя в начало кристалл CLAUDE.md, чтобы субагент запускался от субстрата, а не от сырого текста.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: reads the runtime spawn-log and flags mutating agents recorded without worktree isolation.":                                                                   "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: читать журнал spawn и отмечать изменяющих код агентов, записанных без изоляции worktree.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: appends a stamped comment to a ticket (and a History 'commented' entry).":                                                                                     "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: добавлять в ticket датированный комментарий и запись History 'commented'.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: creates a new on-disk ticket (auto-id, initial status, first History entry).":                                                                                 "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: создавать ticket на диске (автоматический ID, начальный статус, первая запись History).",
		"Not implemented. Historically: edits a ticket's title/body, snapshotting the prior text into History.":                                                                                       "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: изменять заголовок или содержимое ticket, сохраняя прежний текст в History.",
		"Not implemented. Historically: lists tickets, optionally filtered by status or assignee (read-only).":                                                                                        "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: выводить список ticket, при необходимости фильтруя по статусу или исполнителю (только чтение).",
		"Not implemented. Historically: moves a ticket to a new status (relocates the file + records the transition in History).":                                                                     "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: менять статус ticket (перемещать файл и записывать переход в History).",
		"Not implemented. Historically: prints one ticket's header, body, comments and full History (read-only).":                                                                                     "Не реализовано. Историческое назначение: выводить заголовок, содержимое, комментарии и полную History одного ticket (только чтение).",
	})

	add("zh", map[string]string{
		"Usage: hotam gen-spec [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--claude-md <path>]. Regenerates docs/gen/*.md + graph.json for a domain graph from the executable model (internal/generator + internal/ontology), making drift structurally impossible.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            "Usage: hotam gen-spec [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--claude-md <path>]. 根据可执行模型（internal/generator + internal/ontology）重新生成域的 docs/gen/*.md 和 graph.json，从结构上避免漂移。",
		"Usage: hotam what-now [--domain <path>] [--limit N] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. Derives the prioritized next correct action from any graph state (internal/diagnose), making being-lost structurally impossible.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "Usage: hotam what-now [--domain <path>] [--limit N] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. 根据任意图谱状态推导下一个优先且正确的行动（internal/diagnose），从结构上避免迷失方向。",
		"Usage: hotam apply-proposal <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>]. Mechanical writer for resolver-approved JSON proposals (internal/proposal): consumes an approved Proposed* JSON and applies the change to a domain graph.json.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "Usage: hotam apply-proposal <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>]. 机械应用 resolver 已批准的 JSON 提案（internal/proposal），将 Proposed* JSON 的变更写入域 graph.json。",
		"Usage: hotam gate <target-anchor> [--domain <path>]. T1 tiered LAND gate (internal/gate): selects a targeted enforcer subset for a target node instead of the full test suite.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "Usage: hotam gate <target-anchor> [--domain <path>]. T1 分层 LAND gate（internal/gate）：为目标节点选择定向 enforcer 子集，而非运行完整测试套件。",
		"Usage: hotam all-violations [--domain <path>]. Prints all invariant violations for a domain graph (internal/invariants); exits 1 if any are found.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                "Usage: hotam all-violations [--domain <path>]. 输出域图谱的所有不变量违规（internal/invariants）；发现违规时以 1 退出。",
		"Usage: hotam req <show|list|search|context|related> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. Compact agentic read interface over the domain graph (internal/query): answers 'what is R-x' / 'what touches R-x' without loading the full graph.json or a generated doc.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "Usage: hotam req <show|list|search|context|related> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. 域图谱的紧凑代理读取接口（internal/query）：无需加载完整 graph.json 或生成文档即可回答“R-x 是什么”或“哪些内容关联 R-x”。",
		"Usage: hotam brief <anchor-id> [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Single-call aggregation of everything an agent needs to fully orient on one anchor (internal/query.Brief): the full card + one-hop neighborhood + freshness classification for Requirements, replacing the 3-4 separate round-trips (req show + req context + req related + due). Works for Requirement, Conflict, and Assumption anchors alike.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "Usage: hotam brief <anchor-id> [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. 单次汇总代理定位一个锚点所需的信息（internal/query.Brief）：完整卡片、一跳邻域和 Requirement 新鲜度分类，替代 3–4 次独立查询（req show + req context + req related + due）。同样适用于 Requirement、Conflict 和 Assumption 锚点。",
		"Usage: hotam due [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Advisory report of OVERDUE and NEVER-REVIEWED SETTLED requirements (internal/freshness); never gates, exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       "Usage: hotam due [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. 提供 OVERDUE 和从未审阅的 SETTLED requirement 信息报告（internal/freshness）；不作为 gate，退出码始终为 0。",
		"Usage: hotam status [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. Single-shot compact summary combining what-now's top action + debt (internal/diagnose), due's freshness counts (internal/freshness), and all-violations' violation count (internal/invariants), so an agent doesn't need to run all three separately. Never gates; exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       "Usage: hotam status [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--json]. 一次性简要汇总 what-now 的首要行动和欠账（internal/diagnose）、due 的新鲜度计数（internal/freshness）及 all-violations 的违规数量（internal/invariants），无需分别运行三条命令。不作为 gate；退出码始终为 0。",
		"Usage: hotam inspect [--domain <path>] [--json] [--limit N] [--min-score N]. Advisory listing of semantic conflict candidates with evidence (internal/diagnose): shared-assumption clusters, entity-state suspects, lexical claim overlap, axis co-reference. --min-score (default 5) suppresses low-signal candidates; 0 shows all. Never gates; exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             "Usage: hotam inspect [--domain <path>] [--json] [--limit N] [--min-score N]. 提供语义冲突候选及其证据的信息列表（internal/diagnose）：共享假设簇、实体状态疑点、claim 词汇重叠和轴共指。--min-score（默认 5）隐藏弱信号候选；0 显示全部。不作为 gate；退出码始终为 0。",
		"Usage: hotam confront <text> [--domain <path>] [--file <path>] [--json]. CONFRONT step of the mediation loop (internal/diagnose): checks a candidate claim for lexical overlap with SETTLED requirements (duplicate guard) and REJECTED history (anti-relitigation) before anything is written. <text> is a quoted positional; --file <path> reads a long draft. Reuses the inspect overlap engine. Never gates; exit code always 0.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                              "Usage: hotam confront <text> [--domain <path>] [--file <path>] [--json]. mediation loop 的 CONFRONT 步骤（internal/diagnose）：写入前检查候选 claim 与 SETTLED requirements 的词汇重叠（防重复）及 REJECTED history（防止重复讨论）。<text> 是带引号的位置参数；--file <path> 读取长草稿。复用 inspect 重叠引擎。不作为 gate；退出码始终为 0。",
		"Usage: hotam land <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>] [--claude-md <path>]. Single CLI entry point over apply-proposal -> gen-spec -> all-violations (internal/proposal + internal/generator + internal/invariants).":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               "Usage: hotam land <proposal.json> --domain <path> --today YYYY-MM-DD [--batch <dir>] [--claude-md <path>]. apply-proposal -> gen-spec -> all-violations 的统一 CLI 入口（internal/proposal + internal/generator + internal/invariants）。",
		"Usage: hotam init <dir> [--name <domain-name>]. Scaffolds a new domain: minimal graph.json (seed Stakeholder + seed SETTLED Requirement, all-violations=0 immediately), manifest.json, docs/gen/, and a README.md pointing at the next commands to run. <dir> may be anywhere on disk.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            "Usage: hotam init <dir> [--name <domain-name>]. 创建新域：最小 graph.json（初始 Stakeholder 和 SETTLED Requirement，立即满足 all-violations=0）、manifest.json、docs/gen/，以及包含后续命令的 README.md。<dir> 可以位于磁盘任意位置。",
		"Usage: hotam init-project <dir> [--domain <name>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. Bootstraps an external business project's full Hotam-Spec layout in one call: scaffolds a base domain under <dir>/domains/<name> (default main) via init, writes the project-root marker (.hotam-spec-project), and renders the root crystal (CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/GEMINI.md) + all docs/gen/* via gen-spec. Refuses to overwrite an existing project marker or CLAUDE.md.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                 "Usage: hotam init-project <dir> [--domain <name>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD]. 一次调用为外部业务项目建立完整 Hotam-Spec 布局：通过 init 在 <dir>/domains/<name>（默认 main）创建基础域，写入项目根标记（.hotam-spec-project），并通过 gen-spec 生成根晶体（CLAUDE.md/AGENTS.md/GEMINI.md）和所有 docs/gen/*。不会覆盖现有项目标记或 CLAUDE.md。",
		"Usage: hotam use <domain-name>. Sets the active-domain preference for the current project: records {\"active_domain\": \"<name>\"} in the project-root marker so a bare `hotam <command>` (no --domain) targets the chosen domain. Refuses if <root>/domains/<name>/graph.json does not exist.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    "Usage: hotam use <domain-name>. 设置当前项目的活动域偏好：在项目根标记中写入 {\"active_domain\": \"<name>\"}，使不带 --domain 的 `hotam <command>` 使用所选域。如果 <root>/domains/<name>/graph.json 不存在则拒绝执行。",
		"Usage: hotam propose <requirement|rejection|stakeholder|axis|assumption|conflict> [flags] [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--out <path>] [--land] [--claude-md <path>] [--json]. Drafts valid proposal JSON from flags (schema knowledge in the tool, not agent memory), runs an automatic confront check before writing, and optionally --land (apply+regen+reverify) in the same call. Other complex kinds (ConflictTransition, EntityType, …) keep the hand-authored-JSON path (hotam land <file.json>).":                                                                                                                                                "Usage: hotam propose <requirement|rejection|stakeholder|axis|assumption|conflict> [flags] [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--out <path>] [--land] [--claude-md <path>] [--json]. 根据 flags 生成有效提案 JSON（schema 知识属于工具，而非代理记忆），写入前自动执行 confront 检查，也可在同一次调用中执行 --land（apply+regen+reverify）。其他复杂类型（ConflictTransition、EntityType、…）仍使用手写 JSON 路径（hotam land <file.json>）。",
		"Usage: hotam version, hotam --version. Prints the hotam binary's version, commit, and build date (build-time defaults \"dev\"/\"unknown\"/\"unknown\", overridable via -ldflags -X main.version/commit/buildDate).":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                "Usage: hotam version, hotam --version. 输出 hotam 二进制版本、commit 和构建日期（构建默认值为 \"dev\"/\"unknown\"/\"unknown\"，可通过 -ldflags -X main.version/commit/buildDate 覆盖）。",
		"Usage: hotam sync-self [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. Mirrors the engine's own Go requirements registry onto the self-hosting domain's graph.json, this repository's own domain only. Default dry-run computes the pending ADDED/CHANGED sync report, previews the confront/pre-post-violation/append-only gates, and prints a diff-hash; --confirm-hash re-verifies against the current on-disk state and, if every gate passes, writes graph.json, regenerates docs, and re-verifies with all-violations (rolling back on any post-write failure).": "Usage: hotam sync-self [--domain <path>] [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. 将引擎自身 Go requirements registry 镜像到本仓库的 self-hosting 域 graph.json。默认 dry-run 计算待处理的 ADDED/CHANGED 同步报告，预览 confront/pre-post-violation/append-only gates 并输出 diff-hash；--confirm-hash 根据当前磁盘状态重新验证，通过全部 gate 后写入 graph.json、重新生成文档并运行 all-violations 验证（写后失败会回滚）。",
		"Usage: hotam vendor-ontology --domain <path>. Copies the engine's canonical minimal Requirement + Registry[T] mirror (internal/ontology/canon) into <domain>/spec/hotamontology/{requirement,registry}.go, banner-stamped do-not-edit. Requires <domain>/spec/go.mod to already exist (the domain's own Go module for its authored spec/ tree); idempotent, always overwrites with the current canon.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             "Usage: hotam vendor-ontology --domain <path>. 将引擎规范的最小 Requirement + Registry[T] 镜像（internal/ontology/canon）复制到 <domain>/spec/hotamontology/{requirement,registry}.go，并添加禁止手动编辑标记。要求 <domain>/spec/go.mod 已存在（域 authored spec/ 树的 Go module）；操作幂等，总是覆盖为当前规范版本。",
		"Usage: hotam scaffold-registrydump --domain <path>. Writes <domain>/spec/registrydump/main.go, a minimal Go program that imports the domain's own spec/ module root package's Requirements registry plus the vendored spec/hotamontology package, and prints json.Marshal(Requirements.All()) to stdout. Requires spec/go.mod and an already-vendored spec/hotamontology (hotam vendor-ontology run first); idempotent.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           "Usage: hotam scaffold-registrydump --domain <path>. 写入 <domain>/spec/registrydump/main.go，这是一个最小 Go 程序，导入域自身 spec/ module 根包的 Requirements registry 和 vendored spec/hotamontology 包，并将 json.Marshal(Requirements.All()) 输出到 stdout。要求 spec/go.mod 和已 vendored 的 spec/hotamontology（先运行 hotam vendor-ontology）；操作幂等。",
		"Usage: hotam sync-domain --domain <path> [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. Mirrors a CONSUMER domain's own Go requirements registry (spec/requirements.go, read via a `go run ./registrydump` subprocess inside the domain's own spec/ module) onto that domain's graph.json — the domain-scoped generalization of hotam sync-self (task #366, RAC2 Phase B). Same dry-run-by-default / --confirm-hash handshake and confront/violation/append-only gate order as sync-self.":                                                                                              "Usage: hotam sync-domain --domain <path> [--today YYYY-MM-DD] [--confirm-hash <hex>] [--reason \"...\"] [--ack-conflict <C-id>] [--decision-ref \"...\"] [--json]. 将 CONSUMER 域自己的 Go requirements registry（spec/requirements.go，通过域 spec/ module 中的 `go run ./registrydump` subprocess 读取）镜像到该域 graph.json，是 hotam sync-self 的域级通用版本（task #366，RAC2 Phase B）。与 sync-self 使用相同的默认 dry-run、--confirm-hash handshake 和 confront/violation/append-only gate 顺序。",
		"Usage: hotam evidence [--domain <path>] [--json] [--write]. Collects source checks and per-test observations into a fresh evidence report; --write emits docs/gen/EVIDENCE.md, FINDINGS.md, and evidence.json without changing the graph, including when real checks fail.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        "Usage: hotam evidence [--domain <path>] [--json] [--write]. 将来源检查和每个测试的观测收集到新的 evidence report；--write 生成 docs/gen/EVIDENCE.md、FINDINGS.md 和 evidence.json，不修改图谱，即使真实检查失败也会生成。",
		"Usage: hotam findings <list|show|review> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. Reads findings from the latest generated evidence report and stores explicit human classifications, statuses, rationale, and decision references separately from the immutable observed evidence.":                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     "Usage: hotam findings <list|show|review> [args] [--domain <path>] [--json]. 从最新生成的 evidence report 读取 findings，并将明确的人类分类、状态、理由和决策引用与不可变的观测证据分开保存。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: the agent-agnostic CLI over the attention core.":                                                                                                              "尚未实现。历史说明：与 agent 无关的 attention core CLI。",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: the Claude adapter that injects the attention list into context.":                                                    "尚未实现（Python hook 已在 f61a574 移除）。历史说明：将 attention 列表注入上下文的 Claude adapter。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: surfaces Requirements with compound claims and check_* functions with compound conditions, both structural signals for decomposition.":                        "尚未实现。历史说明：展示包含复合 claim 的 Requirements 和包含复合条件的 check_* 函数，作为分解的结构信号。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: the generative-audit tool, a deterministic, LLM-free shortlist of latent-connector suspects.":                                                                 "尚未实现。历史说明：generative-audit 工具，提供确定性且不依赖 LLM 的潜在连接候选列表。",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: auto-injects the diff of CLAUDE.md since the operator's last turn into session context via a UserPromptSubmit hook.": "尚未实现（Python hook 已在 f61a574 移除）。历史说明：通过 UserPromptSubmit hook 将操作者上一轮之后的 CLAUDE.md diff 自动注入会话上下文。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: per-action verify — did the proposal remove its diagnosis?":                                                                                                   "尚未实现。历史说明：逐项验证行动——提案是否消除了诊断出的问题？",
		"Not implemented. Historically: the operator's working-context measurement (reader + CLI dispatcher).":                                                                                        "尚未实现。历史说明：操作者工作上下文测量（reader + CLI dispatcher）。",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: the producer half of the context cipher, writing a runtime context snapshot.":                                        "尚未实现（Python hook 已在 f61a574 移除）。历史说明：context cipher 的生产端，写入运行时上下文快照。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds domains/<domain>/agents/<name>/ as a self-contained sub-operator directory with its own CLAUDE.md, scope, tools/, agents/, and README.md.":          "尚未实现。历史说明：创建 domains/<domain>/agents/<name>/，作为带有自身 CLAUDE.md、scope、tools/、agents/ 和 README.md 的独立子操作者目录。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds a new Axis into the active domain's controlled-vocabulary.":                                                                                         "尚未实现。历史说明：向活动域的受控词汇中创建新的 Axis。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds domains/<name>/ as a self-contained business domain with a manifest, graph.json, tools/, agents/director/, docs/gen/, and CLAUDE.md.":               "尚未实现。历史说明：创建 domains/<name>/ 作为独立业务域，包含 manifest、graph.json、tools/、agents/director/、docs/gen/ 和 CLAUDE.md。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: scaffolds an EntityType declaration into the active domain's graph via apply-proposal.":                                                                       "尚未实现。历史说明：通过 apply-proposal 将 EntityType 声明加入活动域图谱。",
		"Not implemented (the Python hook was removed in f61a574). Historically: emits the three-cipher pulse (top action / debt / context) directly from the active domain's graph.":                 "尚未实现（Python hook 已在 f61a574 移除）。历史说明：直接从活动域图谱生成三类信号（优先行动 / 欠账 / 上下文）。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: reads the runtime land-log and answers the commit-boundary question.":                                                                                         "尚未实现。历史说明：读取运行时 land-log 并回答提交边界问题。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: invokes a sub-agent by loading its CLAUDE.md as the operator-prompt and printing it to stdout.":                                                               "尚未实现。历史说明：加载子代理的 CLAUDE.md 作为操作者提示，并输出到 stdout 以调用子代理。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: records that a DECIDED conflict's revisit_marker was evaluated.":                                                                                              "尚未实现。历史说明：记录 DECIDED 冲突的 revisit_marker 已完成评估。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: single CLI entry point over the low-traffic review tools.":                                                                                                    "尚未实现。历史说明：低频 review 工具的统一 CLI 入口。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: installs/removes the project-local hook that feeds the context producer.":                                                                                     "尚未实现。历史说明：安装或移除为 context producer 提供数据的项目本地 hook。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: generates the committable, portable project sensorium.":                                                                                                       "尚未实现。历史说明：生成可提交、可移植的项目感知机制。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: composes a sub-agent's task prompt by prepending the agent's CLAUDE.md crystal, so the subagent boots from substrate (not from raw text).":                    "尚未实现。历史说明：将代理 CLAUDE.md crystal 置于任务提示开头，使子代理从 substrate 而非原始文本启动。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: reads the runtime spawn-log and flags mutating agents recorded without worktree isolation.":                                                                   "尚未实现。历史说明：读取运行时 spawn-log，并标记未使用 worktree 隔离的变更代理。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: appends a stamped comment to a ticket (and a History 'commented' entry).":                                                                                     "尚未实现。历史说明：向 ticket 追加带时间戳的评论（并添加 History 'commented' 记录）。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: creates a new on-disk ticket (auto-id, initial status, first History entry).":                                                                                 "尚未实现。历史说明：在磁盘上创建 ticket（自动 ID、初始状态和首条 History 记录）。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: edits a ticket's title/body, snapshotting the prior text into History.":                                                                                       "尚未实现。历史说明：编辑 ticket 标题或正文，并将先前文本快照保存到 History。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: lists tickets, optionally filtered by status or assignee (read-only).":                                                                                        "尚未实现。历史说明：列出 ticket，可按状态或负责人筛选（只读）。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: moves a ticket to a new status (relocates the file + records the transition in History).":                                                                     "尚未实现。历史说明：将 ticket 更改为新状态（移动文件并在 History 记录该转换）。",
		"Not implemented. Historically: prints one ticket's header, body, comments and full History (read-only).":                                                                                     "尚未实现。历史说明：只读输出单个 ticket 的标题、正文、评论和完整 History。",
	})
}
